{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-97843adcd4bfdc261d6ddfc8037a2d4a01c84e44 \"Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute.\"]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and then shredded[[cite:obs-b81514ecc6784696fdf05adab690ba4cb8a64c49 \"Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the statute's retention rule and the duration for which records are kept, each statement followed by exact source citations as required."}